WEBVTT

00:00:29.577 --> 00:00:34.224
Lakini pia mtazamo
kuhusu kushinda na kushindwa

00:00:34.248 --> 00:00:35.835
ambayo huja nayo.

00:00:35.859 --> 00:00:37.510
Walio kileleni

00:00:37.534 --> 00:00:41.791
wanaamini ufanisi wao 
ni juhudi yao,

00:00:42.196 --> 00:00:44.196
kipimo cha ustahili wao,

00:00:44.522 --> 00:00:48.950
na walioanguka 
hawana wa kulaumu bali nafsi zao.

00:00:50.177 --> 00:00:52.558
Mtazamo huu wa mafanikio

00:00:52.582 --> 00:00:56.000
unatokana na 
kanuni inayovutia,

00:00:56.772 --> 00:00:59.180
kwamba kila mtu ana nafasi sawa,

00:00:59.204 --> 00:01:02.180
na washindi wanstahili ushindi wao.